  X-Locale: {{locale}}
}

docs {
  # Active regions (districts)

  Public endpoint. Returns all active regions (districts within an oblast)
  sorted by name. Each region includes a nested `oblast` object.

  **Response 200:**
  ```json
  {
    "data": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "name": "Baharly",
        "oblast_id": 1,
        "oblast": { "id": 1, "name": "Ahal" }
      }
    ]
  }
  ```
}
